   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNIR Demokratisk kultur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fundaci&#xf3;n UNIR arbetar med konfliktl&#xf6;sning och utveckling av den      politiska kulturen i demokratisk riktning. Konkreta poster i deras    budget &#xe4;r t ex arbete med medier och st&#xe4;rkande av                     konfliktl&#xf6;sningsmekansimer i offentligen myndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundaci&#xf3;n UNIR works with the solution of conflicts and the           development of political culture towards more democratic mores.       Concrete posts in the organisations budget include work with mass     media and the strengthening of the conflict solution mechanism in     public authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
